I am resting on the sofa.
I am making a video call to my family.
My parents live in Mexico.
They are answering my call.
I see them on the screen.
Mom asks, "Maya, how are you?"
I say, "I am absolutely fine."
My younger sister Sofia is also coming.
Sofia asks, "Maya, what are you doing?"
I laugh.
I say, "I am talking to you!"
I tell them my new daily routine.
I wake up early every day.
I go to the office by bus.
In the evening, I cook food.
Dad says, "This is very good."
Now I am feeling sleepy.
I say goodnight to everyone.
I am turning off my phone.
Now I am going to sleep.
